  "question": {
    "text": "For the reaction,<br /><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8652;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>57.2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br />Which of the following statements is incorrect?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "The equilibrium constant is large suggestive of reaction going to completion and so, no catalyst is required.",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "The equilibrium will shift in forward direction as the pressure increases.",
